# पौने “a quarter less”, and as a clock reading “quarter to” --
# en.wiktionary.org, entry “पौने”, with the usage example “पौने दस” glossed
# 9:45.  It is the ASYMMETRIC member of the set: साढ़े and सवा count forward
# from the hour they name, पौने counts BACK from it, so पौने दस is a quarter
# short of ten and never a quarter past it.  That is why it ships in the
# prev family rather than as a plain fraction.
पौने
